[[34m2026-05-06 10:33:22[0m] use_lora=True, use_lora_before=False, use_lora_after=True, lora_rank=32. Before = LoRA on the encoder stem / early downsampling; after = bottleneck and later decoder. Both can be enabled for two complementary adaptation regions.
